    "Id": "mechdef_hellion_HEN-Z",
    "Name": "Hellion Z",
    "Details": "The Z configuration of the Hellion OmniMech is a Society loadout designed to serve as a spotter. A full complement of jump jets joins the MASC that every Hellion carries, keeping it true to Clan Ice Hellion's focus on speed, while a Nova CEWS is in charge of electronic warfare. For self-defense it carries a Micro Pulse Laser in the head, two ER Medium Lasers in the right arm and a Plasma Cannon in the left arm.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_hellion"
  },
